{
  "name": "Reconciliation state machine",
  "entity_kind": "state machine",
  "context": "Every mutating database edge is one explicit transaction. After the durable begin barrier, synchronize the guard to the committed seal epoch before any KEK access. A successful commit is followed by a fresh snapshot before another edge. A transient error or commit uncertainty returns SAFE_RETRY; it never guesses whether the edge committed. Exact replay states returned by D2a are accepted only after a fresh snapshot rebinds the operation, fence, generations, receipt, and digests."
}

